    [Doc]: Document DeepSeek V4 TurboQuant serving options (#18662)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Document --kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc in the DeepSeek-V4-Flash
    deployment guide.
    
    Explain its memory benefits for ultra-long-context workloads such as AI
    coding, operator requirements, and independence from weight and indexer
    cache quantization. Explicitly state that
      P/D disaggregated deployments are currently unsupported.
    
      ### Does this PR introduce any user-facing change?
    
      No. Documentation-only update; no runtime behavior changes.
    
